---
import FeaturesLayout from '../../layouts/FeaturesLayout.astro';
const codeBlock =
  'bg-cdx-bg-alt/60 text-cdx-text overflow-x-auto rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed';
const inlineCode = 'text-cdx-text bg-cdx-bg-alt rounded px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em]';
---

<FeaturesLayout
  currentSlug="usage"
  title="Usage — compodocx"
  description="Common compodocx command patterns: build, watch, serve, multi-version output, and CI integration."
>
  <p class="text-cdx-text-secondary text-lg">
    A few patterns we lean on. Adapt to taste — every flag has a config equivalent.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-cdx-text text-xl font-semibold mt-12 first:mt-0">Build once for CI</h2>
  {/* prettier-ignore */}
  <pre class:list={codeBlock}><code>npx compodocx -p tsconfig.doc.json</code></pre>

  <h2 class="text-cdx-text text-xl font-semibold mt-12 first:mt-0">Watch during authoring</h2>
  {/* prettier-ignore */}
  <pre class:list={codeBlock}><code>npx compodocx -p tsconfig.doc.json --watch --serve</code></pre>
  <p class="text-cdx-text-secondary">
    The dev server reuses the same routing as production. What you see locally matches what ships.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-cdx-text text-xl font-semibold mt-12 first:mt-0">Multi-version output</h2>
  {/* prettier-ignore */}
  <pre
    class:list={codeBlock}><code>npx compodocx -p tsconfig.doc.json --versionLabel v1.4 --output documentation/v1.4</code></pre>
  <p class="text-cdx-text-secondary">
    A <code class={inlineCode}>versions.json</code> manifest is written at the output root. The version-switcher
    widget reads it at runtime — no extra wiring.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-cdx-text text-xl font-semibold mt-12 first:mt-0">Wire into npm scripts</h2>
  {/* prettier-ignore */}
  <pre
    class:list={codeBlock}><code>"docs": "compodocx -p tsconfig.doc.json",
"docs:watch": "compodocx -p tsconfig.doc.json --watch --serve"</code></pre>

  <h2 class="text-cdx-text text-xl font-semibold mt-12 first:mt-0">API diff in CI</h2>
  {/* prettier-ignore */}
  <pre
    class:list={codeBlock}><code>npx compodocx diff --against last-tag --exportFormat json</code></pre>
  <p class="text-cdx-text-secondary">
    Compares the current API against the previous tag, exits with code 1 on breaking changes (per
    semver), 0 otherwise. Pipe the JSON to your bot of choice for PR comments.
  </p>
</FeaturesLayout>
